OL,3,GNEWSA'You makes Barry proud' Nessa
OL,4,Atells Gavin & Stacey co-star ahead of
OL,5,AI'm a Celebrity
OL,6,
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey's Nessa Jenkins has
OL,8,Furged co-star Joanna Page to "have a
OL,9,Fcrackin time" ahead of her I'm a
OL,10,FCelebrity debut.
OL,12,FPage, who played Stacey Shipman in the
OL,13,FBBC comedy, is joining this year's
OL,14,Fline-up on the forthcoming reality TV
OL,15,Fshow.
OL,17,FThe 49-year-old, from Swansea, said she
OL,18,Fhas her sights on becoming the first
OL,19,FWelsh Queen of the Jungle, and co-star
OL,20,FRuth Jones, aka Nessa Jenkins, is
OL,21,F"beyond excited".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
