OL,3,GNEWSA'You makes Barry proud' Nessa
OL,4,Atells Gavin & Stacey co-star ahead of
OL,5,AI'm a Celebrity
OL,6,
OL,7,F"O! Stace - they're gonna make you
OL,8,Fstick all manner of matter in your gob.
OL,9,FAnd I'm not talking Gwen's omelettes...
OL,10,FJust don't over do it, alrigh'? You
OL,11,Fknows what a weak constitution you
OL,12,Fhas," she wrote, in a message from
OL,13,FNessa, on Instagram.
